[2.257, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[6A\t\t  \u001b[90mGemini 4 Argon (Medium)\u001b[m\n\u001b[23D\u001b[90m~/tmp/agy_genui_demo\u001b[m\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[59C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[4.852, "o", "\u001b[?2026hPlease build a macOS desktop Markdown chat application in this project using `flutter_markdown_plus` with the\r\n  following features:\u001b[K\r\n  1. A collapsible macOS split-view conversation thread sidebar with per-thread typing state, automatic thread\u001b[K\r\n  titling, and starter threads showcasing rich Markdown.\r\n  2. Markdown message rendering (headings, bold/italic/strikethrough, inline and fenced code blocks, blockquotes,\r\n  lists, and GitHub-style tables) with a one-click Copy Markdown button on every message bubble.\r\n  3. A Markdown composer that restores focus after sending, with a formatting toolbar (Bold, Italic, Inline Code, Code\r\n  Block, List, Blockquote), a live Markdown preview toggle, and desktop keyboard shortcuts (`Enter` or `Numpad Enter`\r\n  to send, `Shift + Enter` for a newline with an IME composition guard).\r\n  4. A responsive top toolbar with Light and Dark Material 3 theme switching.\r\n  5. Widget tests in `test/widget_test.dart` and macOS build/run instructions in `README.md`.\r\n\u001b[90m"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[97C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[2A\u001b[93C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.874, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[7A\u001b[J\u001b[3A\u001b[2C\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m? for shortcuts\u001b[m\u001b[82X\u001b[82C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.032, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001bM\u001b[58C\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please build a macOS desktop Markdown chat application in this project using `flutter_markdown_plus` with the\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  following features:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  1. A collapsible macOS split-view conversation thread sidebar with per-thread typing state, automatic thread titling,\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  and starter threads showcasing rich Markdown.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  2. Markdown message rendering (headings, bold/italic/strikethrough, inline and fenced code blocks, blockquotes,\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  lists, and GitHub-style tables) with a one-click Copy Markdown button on every message bubble.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  3. A Markdown composer that restores focus after sending, with a formatting toolbar (Bold, Italic, Inline Code, Code\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  Block, List, Blockquote), a live Markdown preview toggle, and desktop keyboard shortcuts (`Enter` or `Numpad Enter`\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  to send, `Shift + Enter` for a newline with an IME composition guard).\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  4. A responsive top toolbar with Light and Dark Material 3 theme sw"]
[0.000, "o", "itching.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  5. Widget tests in `test/widget_test.dart` and macOS build/run instructions in `README.md`.\u001b[m\r\n⣷  \u001b[90mGen\u001b[94merati\u001b[90mng...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
