[0.000, "o", "107;199;163;48;2;100;182;246m▀\u001b[38;2;100;182;246;49m▀\u001b[m \u001b[5b\u001b[38;2;56;134;251m▀\u001b[38;2;72;129;244;48;2;56;131;249m▀\u001b[38;2;61;133;252;49m▄\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please build a macOS desktop Markdown chat application in this project using `flutter_markdown_plus` with the\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  following features:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  1. A collapsible macOS split-view conversation thread sidebar with per-thread typing state, automatic thread titling,\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  and starter threads showcasing rich Markdown.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  2. Markdown message rendering (headings, bold/italic/strikethrough, inline and fenced code blocks, blockquotes,\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  lists, and GitHub-style tables) with a one-click Copy Markdown button on every message bubble.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  3. A Markdown composer that restores focus after sending, with a f"]
[0.000, "o", "ormatting toolbar (Bold, Italic, Inline Code, Code\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  Block, List, Blockquote), a live Markdown preview toggle, and desktop keyboard shortcuts (`Enter` or `Numpad Enter`\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  to send, `Shift + Enter` for a newline with an IME composition guard).\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  4. A responsive top toolbar with Light and Dark Material 3 theme switching.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  5. Widget tests in `test/widget_test.dart` and macOS build/run instructions in `README.md`.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 1m 0s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial thought: Creating the data model for chat messages and threads requires defining immut...)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 7 files \u001b[37m(pubspec.yaml, main.dart, widget_test.dart, +4)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(flutter pub add flutter_markdown_plus markdown)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(chat_models.dart)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n⡿  \u001b[90mEditing files...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: To disable tips, toggle Show Tips in /settings.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──"]
