[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please add the `antigravity` package dependency and integrate it as the backend for the Markdown chat in this app.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  Update the macOS entitlements so the app can spawn the local harness, and update README.md and the widget tests.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 6m 38s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(README needs updating to reflect the new integration of the `antigravity` package. This invol...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 2 files \u001b[37m(pubspec.yaml, README.md)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[42D\u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(find lib test macos -maxdepth 4 -type f)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m… 34 more actions (28 reads, 1 edit, 5 commands: 1 failed) …\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 6 files \u001b[37m(DebugProfile.entitlements, Release.entitlements, chat_repository.dart, +3)\u001b[m\n\u001b[90D\u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 2 commands \u001b[37m(dart analyze && flutter test · git"]
[0.000, "o", " status -s)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  The \u001b[94mantigravity\u001b[m package has been added and integrated as the backend for the macOS Markdown chat application:\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mPackage Dependency (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb9911075a21fa6ad;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/pubspec.yaml#L30-L40\u0007p\u001b[22mubspec.yaml:30-40\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\r\n      • Added \u001b[94mantigravity: ^0.18.1\u001b[m under \u001b[94mdependencies\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mAntigravity Chat Backend (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk46f7de55384cdc80;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_repository.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk209355c98b82f8f9;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_view_model.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\r\n      • Implemented \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4d012f2c23bde521;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L9-L17\u0007AntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7ca59f117bea1612;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy"]
