[0.000, "o", " status -s)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  The \u001b[94mantigravity\u001b[m package has been added and integrated as the backend for the macOS Markdown chat application:\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mPackage Dependency (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4897a5e8ec73e343;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/pubspec.yaml#L30-L40\u0007p\u001b[22mubspec.yaml:30-40\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\r\n      • Added \u001b[94mantigravity: ^0.18.1\u001b[m under \u001b[94mdependencies\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mAntigravity Chat Backend (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbc2241816bbb596e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_repository.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcbe5e7b7fd2736c3;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_view_model.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\r\n      • Implemented \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk23e1be1d28422f2f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L9-L17\u0007AntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc16274d38683c000;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy"]
[0.000, "o", "_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L21-L57\u0007LocalAntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 wrapping \u001b[94mpackage:antigravity\u001b[m's \u001b[94mAgent\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mLocalAgentConfig\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCustomSystemInstructions\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mChatResponse.textStream\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[72D• Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfd9cda03b27e1193;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L68-L199\u0007ChatRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to manage per-thread \u001b[94mAntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m instances, build thread-aware\n\u001b[99D\u001b[94mLocalAgentConfig\u001b[m instances (\u001b[94mGEMINI_API_KEY\u001b[m from \u001b[94m--dart-define\u001b[m or \u001b[94mPlatform.environment\u001b[m), stream response chunks\r\n\u001b[6Cvia \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka5770ea390d757e8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L155-L165\u0007ChatRepository.streamAssistantReply\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and stop sessions on thread deletion or disposal.\u001b[K\n\u001b[90D• Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk57b4c66c8c267fc6;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_mod"]
