[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37;1mRequesting permission for:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m   git add -A && git commit -m \"Integrate antigravity SDK backend and update macOS entitlements\" && git tag\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37mstep-02-antigravity-sdk && git log -n 2 --oneline --decorate\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mRun this command?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, run command\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. Yes, and always allow in this conversation for commands that start with 'git add'\r\n  3. Yes, and always allow for commands that start with 'git add' (Persist to settings.json)\r\n  4. No, cancel\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mctrl+g\u001b[90;22m edit/expand command\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
