[0.000, "o", "n\u001b[m\r\n  was invoked (e.g., \u001b[94m/Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo\u001b[m).\r\n  • \u001b[1mLaunched from Finder / Dock / \u001b[94;22mopen\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22magy_genui_demo.app\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: macOS \u001b[94mlaunchd\u001b[m sets the process working directory of GUI\r\n  app bundles to \u001b[94m/\u001b[m (the root directory), unless changed or overridden.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Program Review\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[1m#### Strengths\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mClean Layered Architecture\u001b[m: Clear separation between domain models (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3d38a0a51f76e4e6;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart\u0007chat_models.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), data/SDK session\r\n  management (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk493666e7e6f0befd;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart\u0007chat_repository.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), state management (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb18cbe8b819dc328;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007chat_view_model.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), and UI widgets.\r\n  • \u001b[1mPer-Thread Stream & Lifecycle Iso"]
