[0.000, "o", ";\u0007 tracks \u001b[94m_activeRequestIds\u001b[m and\r\n  \u001b[94m_replySubscriptions\u001b[m per \u001b[94mthreadId\u001b[m, allowing background threads to continue streaming while the user switches threads,\r\n  and cleanly stops the \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m process via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk648a9b8a133e52f9;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L192-L197\u0007ChatRepository.closeThreadSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 when a thread is deleted.\r\n  • \u001b[1mDesktop UX Details\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6e268852fabc73eb;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/markdown_composer.dart#L38-L69\u0007MarkdownComposer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 properly guards \u001b[94mEnter\u001b[m-to-send against active macOS IME composition\r\n  (\u001b[94m_isImeComposing\u001b[m) and supports \u001b[94mShift + Enter\u001b[m for newlines.\r\n  • \u001b[1mTestability\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk49ba927be43b0c0e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L9-L18\u0007AntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5802a0cd90f747af;file:///Users/brett/tmp/ag"]
[0.000, "o", "y_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L63-L67\u0007AntigravitySessionBuilder\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 allow \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkde1bd3564b6937e5;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/test/widget_test.dart\u0007widget_test.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to test streaming,\r\n  error formatting, and session teardown deterministically without spawning real \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m processes.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m#### Potential Issues & Observations\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mImplicit \u001b[94;22mDirectory.current\u001b[39;1m Workspace in Release \u001b[94;22m.app\u001b[39;1m Builds\u001b[m\n\u001b[58D• Because \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4c06dc5c7657a94c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L113-L138\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 leaves \u001b[94mworkspaces\u001b[m as \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m by default, launching the release \u001b[94m.app\u001b[m from\r\n\u001b[6CFinder will configure \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m with \u001b[94m/\u001b[m as its workspace root. Built-in file/search tools (\u001b[94mfind\u001b[m, \u001b[94mgrep_search\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mlist_dir\u001b[m, \u001b[94mview_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mwrite_to_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mfile_edit\u001b[m) rema"]
[0.000, "o", "in enabled by default in \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig()\u001b[m, meaning the\r\n\u001b[6Cagent's workspace root becomes \u001b[94m/\u001b[m when launched outside a terminal.\n\u001b[66D• \u001b[1mRecommendation\u001b[m: Explicitly pass an intended workspace directory (such as a dedicated app support/workspace\r\n\u001b[6Cfolder or user-selected directory) or, if this app is intended as a pure chat assistant without filesystem\r\n\u001b[6Caccess, disable built-in file tools via \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig(enabledTools: const [])\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mThread Title Locked In at Session Creation\u001b[m\n\u001b[41D• In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7582977e5878c967;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L142-L157\u0007ChatRepository.getOrCreateSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mbuildAgentConfig\u001b[m embeds \u001b[94mthreadTitle\u001b[m into \u001b[94mCustomSystemInstructions\u001b[m only\r\n\u001b[6Cwhen the session is first created (\u001b[94m_sessions.putIfAbsent\u001b[m). That works well with the current auto-titling flow\r\n\u001b[6C(since auto-titling runs before the first message creates the session), but if thread"]
[0.000, "o", " renaming is ever added\r\n\u001b[6Clater, the existing session's system instructions will retain the initial title.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mComposer State Shared Across Thread Switches\u001b[m\n\u001b[43D• [\u001b[94mMa\u001b[m\r\n\n⣷  \u001b[90mGenerating...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · m"]
