[0.000, "o", "4;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mV\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mw\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mM\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m.\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mM\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ tracks \u001b[94m_activeRequestIds\u001b[m and\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[94m_replySubscriptions\u001b[m per \u001b[94mthreadId\u001b[m, allowing background threads to continue streaming while the user switches threads,\r\n  and cleanly stops the \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m process via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka4de6ed247fef37e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L192-L197\u0007ChatRepository.closeThreadSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 when a thread is deleted.\r\n  • \u001b[1mDesktop UX Details\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6432808b4bf32b12;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/markdown_composer.dart#L38-L69\u0007MarkdownComposer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 properly guards \u001b[94mEnter\u001b[m-to-send against active macOS IME"]
[0.001, "o", " composition\r\n  (\u001b[94m_isImeComposing\u001b[m) and supports \u001b[94mShift + Enter\u001b[m for newlines.\r\n  • \u001b[1mTestability\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf88583553f3b145b;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L9-L18\u0007AntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke039c8d500d6e080;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L63-L67\u0007AntigravitySessionBuilder\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 allow \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc869c8c20955205c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/test/widget_test.dart\u0007widget_test.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to test streaming,\r\n  error formatting, and session teardown deterministically without spawning real \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m processes.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m#### Potential Issues & Observations\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mImplicit \u001b[94;22mDirectory.current\u001b[39;1m Workspace in Release \u001b[94;22m.app\u001b[39;1m Builds\u001b[m\n\u001b[58D• Because \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk89b62f8de537bf0f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L113-L138\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]"]
[0.000, "o", "8;;\u0007 leaves \u001b[94mworkspaces\u001b[m as \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m by default, launching the release \u001b[94m.app\u001b[m from\r\n\u001b[6CFinder will configure \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m with \u001b[94m/\u001b[m as its workspace root. Built-in file/search tools (\u001b[94mfind\u001b[m, \u001b[94mgrep_search\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mlist_dir\u001b[m, \u001b[94mview_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mwrite_to_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mfile_edit\u001b[m) remain enabled by default in \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig()\u001b[m, meaning the\r\n\u001b[6Cagent's workspace root becomes \u001b[94m/\u001b[m when launched outside a terminal.\n\u001b[66D• \u001b[1mRecommendation\u001b[m: Explicitly pass an intended workspace directory (such as a dedicated app support/workspace\r\n\u001b[6Cfolder or user-selected directory) or, if this app is intended as a pure chat assistant without filesystem\r\n\u001b[6Caccess, disable built-in file tools via \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig(enabledTools: const [])\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mThread Title Locked In at Session Creation\u001b[m\n\u001b[41D• In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk790192e45f6b9578;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L142-L157\u0007ChatRepository.g"]
[0.000, "o", "etOrCreateSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mbuildAgentConfig\u001b[m embeds \u001b[94mthreadTitle\u001b[m into \u001b[94mCustomSystemInstructions\u001b[m only\r\n\u001b[6Cwhen the session is first created (\u001b[94m_sessions.putIfAbsent\u001b[m). That works well with the current auto-titling flow\r\n\u001b[6C(since auto-titling runs before the first message creates the session), but if thread renaming is ever added\r\n\u001b[6Clater, the existing session's system instructions will retain the initial title.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mComposer State Shared Across Thread Switches\u001b[m\n\u001b[43D•\n\b[\u001b[94mMarkdownComposer\u001b[m](file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/markdown_composer.\r\n\u001b[6Cdart#L2\r\n\n⡿  \u001b[90mGenerating...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
