[0.000, "o", "4696dced7;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L63-L67\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mA\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mv\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4my\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mS\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mB\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ allow \u001b]8;id=jkdd1b18e687025cbd;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/test/widget_test.dart\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mw\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m_\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m.\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ to test streaming,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  error formatting, and session teardown deterministically without spawning real \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m processes.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m#### Potential Issues & Observations\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mImplicit \u001b[94;22mDirectory.current\u001b[39;1m Workspace in Release \u001b[94;22m.app\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "39;1m Builds\u001b[m\n\u001b[58D• Because \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3eeefdad9f8dac94;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L113-L138\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 leaves \u001b[94mworkspaces\u001b[m as \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m by default, launching the release \u001b[94m.app\u001b[m from\r\n\u001b[6CFinder will configure \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m with \u001b[94m/\u001b[m as its workspace root. Built-in file/search tools (\u001b[94mfind\u001b[m, \u001b[94mgrep_search\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mlist_dir\u001b[m, \u001b[94mview_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mwrite_to_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mfile_edit\u001b[m) remain enabled by default in \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig()\u001b[m, meaning the\r\n\u001b[6Cagent's workspace root becomes \u001b[94m/\u001b[m when launched outside a terminal.\n\u001b[66D• \u001b[1mRecommendation\u001b[m: Explicitly pass an intended workspace directory (such as a dedicated app support/workspace\r\n\u001b[6Cfolder or user-selected directory) or, if this app is intended as a pure chat assistant without filesystem\r\n\u001b[6Caccess, disable built-in file tools via \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig(enabledTools: const [])\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mThrea"]
[0.000, "o", "d Title Locked In at Session Creation\u001b[m\n\u001b[41D• In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd4590c603d32f32f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L142-L157\u0007ChatRepository.getOrCreateSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mbuildAgentConfig\u001b[m embeds \u001b[94mthreadTitle\u001b[m into \u001b[94mCustomSystemInstructions\u001b[m only\r\n\u001b[6Cwhen the session is first created (\u001b[94m_sessions.putIfAbsent\u001b[m). That works well with the current auto-titling flow\r\n\u001b[6C(since auto-titling runs before the first message creates the session), but if thread renaming is ever added\r\n\u001b[6Clater, the existing session's system instructions will retain the initial title.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mComposer State Shared Across Thread Switches\u001b[m\n\u001b[43D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke574019f330a822e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/markdown_composer.dart#L27-L30\u0007MarkdownComposer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 holds a single \u001b[94mTextEditingController\u001b[m not keyed by \u001b[94mactiveThreadId\u001b[m. If a user types a draft in\r\n\u001b[6CThread A and clicks Thread B in \u001b[34;4m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b]8;id=jk8015991529845862;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/thread_sidebar.dart\u0007ThreadSidebar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, the unsent draft remains in the input box for Thread B.\r\n\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> 1. Add a concept of projects that set a working directory for the Antigravity harness.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  2. I'm guessing workspaceOnly enables commands that are inside the sandbox. We should add UI that allows programs to\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  be run that want to escape the sandbox, but only after review by the user.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  3. Update README.md and add `/skills/` to `.gitignore`.\u001b[m\r\n⣻  \u001b[90mGeneratin\u001b[94mg...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
