[0.000, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37;1mRequesting permission for:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m   python3 -c '\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m   with open(\"/Users/brett/.antigravity/bin/localharness\", \"rb\") as f:\u001b[m\n\u001b[64D\u001b[37m\u001b[1K data = f.read()\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m   for needle in [b\"BypassSandbox\", b\"UnsafeNoSandbox\", b\"sandbox command auto-approved\"]:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m   ⋯ (9 lines hidden)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mRun this command?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, run command\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. Yes, and always allow in this conversation for commands that start with 'python3 -c '\u001b[K\r\nwith open(\"/Users/brett/.antigravity/bin/localharness\", \"rb\") as f:...'\u001b[K\r\n  3. Yes, and always allow for commands that start with 'python3 -c '\r\nwith open(\"/Users/brett/.antigravity"]
