[12.488, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[31A      when the session is first created (\u001b[94m_sessions.putIfAbsent\u001b[m). That works well with the current auto-titling flow\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[0 q\u001b[J\u001b[6C(since auto-titling runs before the first message creates the session), but if thread renaming is ever added\r\n\u001b[6Clater, the existing session's system instructions will retain the initial title.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mComposer State Shared Across Thread Switches\u001b[m\n\u001b[43D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke574019f330a822e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/markdown_composer.dart#L27-L30\u0007MarkdownComposer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 holds a single \u001b[94mTextEditingController\u001b[m not keyed by \u001b[94mactiveThreadId\u001b[m. If a user types a draft in\r\n\u001b[6CThread A and clicks Thread B in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8015991529845862;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/thread_sidebar.dart\u0007ThreadSidebar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, the unsent draft remains in the input box for Thread B.\r\n\n\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "──────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> 1. Add a concept of projects that set a working directory for the Antigravity harness.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  2. I'm guessing workspaceOnly enables commands that are inside the sandbox. We should add UI that allows programs to\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  be run that want to escape the sandbox, but only after review by the user.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  3. Update README.md and add `/skills/` to `.gitignore`.\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 3m 7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial analysis suggests that the `workspaceOnly` setting within the observed package might c...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 5 files \u001b[37m(policy.dart, hooks.dart, capabilities.dart, +2)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(grep -rn \"workspaceOnly\\|enableSandbox\\|confirmRunCommand\\|disable_sandbox\\|DisableSandbox\\|sandbox\" /Users/...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m… 12 more actions (9 reads, 3 commands) …\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(README.md)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan"]
