[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A\u001b[1m### 1. Projects & Working Directory for the Antigravity Harness\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mDomain Model\u001b[m: Added \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfa4d419f4d57238e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart#L9-L36\u0007ChatProject\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (storing \u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mworkingDirectory\u001b[m) and scoped \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6e50a1cab4fddb76;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart#L60-L98\u0007ChatThread\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to \u001b[94mprojectId\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[1mSafe Default & Workspace Configuration\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4df0da4d6085d526;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L132-L141\u0007ChatRepository.resolveDefaultWorkingDirectory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 uses \u001b[94mDirectory.current.absolute.path\u001b[m when launched from a\r\n\u001b[6Cterminal, and falls back to \u001b[94m$HOME\u001b[m (or \u001b[94mDirectory.systemTemp\u001b[m) when \u001b[94mDirectory.current\u001b[m is \u001b[94m/\u001b[m (e.g., when a macOS \u001b[94m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mapp\u001b[m bundle is launched from Finder).\u001b[K\n\u001b[36D• \u001b[34;"]
[0.001, "o", "4m\u001b]8;id=jkbb6ef803d8ca95e3;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L294-L364\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 passes the active project's normalized \u001b[94mworkingDirectory\u001b[m into\n\u001b[94D\u001b[94mLocalAgentConfig(workspaces: [activeDir], ...)\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[47D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcef30bbcc0bc8592;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L179-L205\u0007ChatViewModel.updateProject\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 closes any running sessions in that project when its working directory changes so\r\n\u001b[6Csubsequent messages spawn \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m with the updated workspace.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mUI\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • Added \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd4f4333ec9cdc801;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/project_dialog.dart\u0007ProjectDialog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 for creating projects and editing a project's working directory (with quick presets for\r\n\u001b[6CCurrent Directory, Home \u001b[94m~\u001b[m, and System Temp).\u001b[K\n\u001b[44D• Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6c7e2f022d13f"]
[0.000, "o", "d8d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/thread_sidebar.dart\u0007ThreadSidebar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with a project switcher header, working directory path badge, and buttons to create or\r\n\u001b[6Cedit projects.\u001b[K\n\u001b[14D• Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb4d2e320143330f8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u0007TopToolbar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with a clickable workspace path badge (\u001b[94mtoolbar_project_badge\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[K\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2. Sandboxing, \u001b[94mworkspaceOnly\u001b[39m, & Sandbox-Escape User Review UI\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mHow \u001b[94;22mpackage:antigravity\u001b[39;1m separates these layers\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[94mworkspaceOnly(workspaces)\u001b[m only confines \u001b[1mfile manipulation tools\u001b[m (\u001b[94mview_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcreate_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94medit_file\u001b[m) to the\r\n\u001b[6Cworkspace when paired with \u001b[94mallowAll()\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[38D• \u001b[94mCa\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[8D\u001b[?2026l"]
