[0.084, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A      • \u001b]8;id=jk98b13f2f0b7fb91d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L179-L205\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mV\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mw\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mM\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m.\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mP\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mj\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ closes any running sessions in that project when its working directory changes so\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6Csubsequent messages spawn \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m with the updated workspace.\r\n  • \u001b[1mUI\u001b[m:\n\b• Added \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb5f9804571fa0711;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/project_dialog.dart\u0007ProjectDialog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 for creating projects and editing a project's working directory (with quick presets for\r\n\u001b[6CCurrent Directory, Home \u001b[94m~\u001b[m, and System Temp).\n\u001b[44D• Upda"]
[0.000, "o", "ted \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2ac5eb737f27753d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/thread_sidebar.dart\u0007ThreadSidebar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with a project switcher header, working directory path badge, and buttons to create or\r\n\u001b[6Cedit projects.\n\u001b[14D• Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7545e4abc4ef0a08;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u0007TopToolbar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with a clickable workspace path badge (\u001b[94mtoolbar_project_badge\u001b[m).\r\n\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2. Sandboxing, \u001b[94mworkspaceOnly\u001b[39m, & Sandbox-Escape User Review UI\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mHow \u001b[94;22mpackage:antigravity\u001b[39;1m separates these layers\u001b[m:\n\u001b[45D• \u001b[94mworkspaceOnly(workspaces)\u001b[m only confines \u001b[1mfile manipulation tools\u001b[m (\u001b[94mview_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcreate_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94medit_file\u001b[m) to the\r\n\u001b[6Cworkspace when paired with \u001b[94mallowAll()\u001b[m.\n\u001b[38D• \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig(runCommandConfig: RunCommandConfig(enableSandbox: true))\u001b[m enables the \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m OS-level\r\n\u001b[6Ccommand sandbox (\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[94mexebox\u001b[m) so standard \u001b[94mrun_command\u001b[m executions (\u001b[94mBypassSandbox: false\u001b[m) run confined to the project\r\n\u001b[6Cworkspace.\n\u001b[10D• Commands that want to escape the sandbox either set \u001b[94mBypassSandbox: true\u001b[m on \u001b[94mrun_command\u001b[m, reference paths\r\n\u001b[6Coutside the project workspace, or are flagged by \u001b[94mauto(handler: ...)\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[1mImplementation\u001b[m:\n\u001b[13D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1d854604aac0ca04;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L294-L364\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 configures \u001b[94mRunCommandConfig(enableSandbox: true)\u001b[m alongside\n\u001b[92D\u001b[94mworkspaceOnly(resolvedWorkspaces)\u001b[m, an \u001b[94maskUser\u001b[m policy on \u001b[94mrun_command\u001b[m matching\n\u001b[76D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk245abd8118ba08c2;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L221-L230\u0007ChatRepository.isSandboxEscapeToolCall\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mauto(handler: ...)\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mallowAll()\u001b[m.\n\u001b[75D• Added \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka47910b1c6188298;file:///Users/brett/tmp"]
