[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A      • Updated \u001b]8;id=jk70b1947dcc6d8aa2;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mT\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mT\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mb\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ with a clickable workspace path badge (\u001b[94mtoolbar_project_badge\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2. Sandboxing, \u001b[94mworkspaceOnly\u001b[39m, & Sandbox-Escape User Review UI\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mHow \u001b[94;22mpackage:antigravity\u001b[39;1m separates these layers\u001b[m:\n\u001b[45D• \u001b[94mworkspaceOnly(workspaces)\u001b[m only confines \u001b[1mfile manipulation tools\u001b[m (\u001b[94mview_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcreate_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94medit_file\u001b[m) to the\r\n\u001b[6Cworkspace when paired with \u001b[94mallowAll()\u001b[m.\n\u001b[38D• \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig(runCommandConfig: RunCommandConfig(enableSandbox: true))\u001b[m enables the \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m OS-level\r\n\u001b[6Ccommand sandbox (\u001b[94mexebox\u001b[m) so standard \u001b[94mrun_command\u001b[m executions (\u001b[94mBypassSandbox: false\u001b[m) run confined to the project\r\n\u001b[6Cw"]
[0.000, "o", "orkspace.\n\u001b[10D• Commands that want to escape the sandbox either set \u001b[94mBypassSandbox: true\u001b[m on \u001b[94mrun_command\u001b[m, reference paths\r\n\u001b[6Coutside the project workspace, or are flagged by \u001b[94mauto(handler: ...)\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[1mImplementation\u001b[m:\n\u001b[13D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdeb2fd4bd77e80da;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L294-L364\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 configures \u001b[94mRunCommandConfig(enableSandbox: true)\u001b[m alongside\n\u001b[92D\u001b[94mworkspaceOnly(resolvedWorkspaces)\u001b[m, an \u001b[94maskUser\u001b[m policy on \u001b[94mrun_command\u001b[m matching\n\u001b[76D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9c66b87813c23f28;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L221-L230\u0007ChatRepository.isSandboxEscapeToolCall\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mauto(handler: ...)\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mallowAll()\u001b[m.\n\u001b[75D• Added \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1b9655843d40722;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart#L102-L130\u0007PendingCommandReview\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk153ecdc596c5a"]
[0.000, "o", "579;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/sandbox_review_banner.dart\u0007SandboxReviewBanner\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, rendered in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9b00790981d5d86e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L115-L119\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 above the composer whenever a\r\n\u001b[6Ccommand requests to escape the sandbox, allowing the user to inspect the command line, project workspace, and\r\n\u001b[6Creason before clicking \u001b[1mApprove & Run\u001b[m or \u001b[1mDeny\u001b[m.\r\n\n\n  \u001b[1m### 3. Documentation, \u001b[94m.gitignore\u001b[39m, & Tests\u001b[m\r\n\n  • Added \u001b[94m/skills/\u001b[m to \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbc1d876a977292e5;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/.gitignore#L49-L51\u0007.gitignore:49-51\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  • Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf326032de5501bb2;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/README.md\u0007README.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with sections covering project working directories and the sandbox-escape review workflow.\r\n  • Added wid\r\n⣟  \u001b[94mWor\u001b[90mking...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m▸ Please fix issues highlighted in the revi"]
