[0.000, "o", ".app\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cbuilds never silently fall back to \u001b[94m/\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mSession Refresh When Thread Title or Workspace Metadata Changes\u001b[m\n\u001b[62D• Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk18d4d06bc1da116;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L261-L296\u0007ChatRepository.getOrCreateSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to track \u001b[94m_sessionMetadata\u001b[m (\u001b[94mthreadTitle\u001b[m, \u001b[94mprojectId\u001b[m, and\n\u001b[98D\u001b[94mworkingDirectory\u001b[m) per \u001b[94mthreadId\u001b[m. If any of those change (for example, when a thread is auto-titled or renamed\r\n\u001b[6Cvia \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4931870f2f928d0e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L254-L273\u0007ChatViewModel.renameThread\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), the stale \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb604e3d450ab866a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L11-L15\u0007AntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 is stopped and replaced with a session\r\n\u001b[6Ccarrying the updated system instructions and workspace configuration.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mPer-Thread Composer Dr"]
