[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  • \u001b[1mReactive Surface Widget\u001b[m: \u001b]8;id=jk29f5ca1e349d6b61;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/a2ui_surface.dart#L35\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mA\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m2\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mS\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mf\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ takes a \u001b[94mSurfaceModel<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m, attaches a\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[94mNodeResolver<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m, and rebuilds only the affected widget subtrees as signals in the surface's\r\n  component/data models change.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m## 2. The Exact Seamlines Between the Packages\u001b[m\r\n\n  There are \u001b[1mfour key seamlines\u001b[m where these packages connect:\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Seamline 1: \u001b[94mComponentApi\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94mComponentImplementation\u001b[39m (\u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[39m & \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m is generic over \u001b[94mT extends ComponentApi\u001b[m.\r\n\n  • A backend-only agent uses \u001b[94mCatalogApi\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentApi, Func"]
[0.000, "o", "tionApi>\u001b[m), which only carries JSON Schemas\r\n  (\u001b[94mBasicCatalog.v1_0()\u001b[m).\r\n  • A Flutter app uses \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd795a0a06a2c94c1;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L64\u0007CatalogImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentImplementation, FunctionImplementation>\u001b[m from\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk85807e9132e4bf3a;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/catalog/basic/basic_catalog.dart#L43\u0007basicCatalog()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007). Because \u001b[94mComponentImplementation extends ComponentApi\u001b[m, the \u001b[1mexact same\u001b[m \u001b[94mCatalogImplementation\u001b[m object\r\n  can be passed to both:\n\u001b[18D• \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk658891e25ba61cd3;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L134\u0007CatalogConfig(a2uiCatalog)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which reads the schema/instructions to prompt and validate the LLM),\r\n\u001b[6Cand\n\b\b\b• \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m's \u001b[94;1m\u001b]8;id=jk286d0b379e783c2d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genu"]
