[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A• A backend-only agent uses \u001b[94mCatalogApi\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentApi, FunctionApi>\u001b[m), which only carries JSON Schemas\r\n  (\u001b[94mBasicCatalog.v1_0()\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • A Flutter app uses \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9eec4bbcbe085f73;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L64\u0007CatalogImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentImplementation, FunctionImplementation>\u001b[m from\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6223578e2e484a50;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/catalog/basic/basic_catalog.dart#L43\u0007basicCatalog()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007). Because \u001b[94mComponentImplementation extends ComponentApi\u001b[m, the \u001b[1mexact same\u001b[m \u001b[94mCatalogImplementation\u001b[m object\r\n  can be passed to both:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5c6cf73d586e8795;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L134\u0007CatalogConfig(a2uiCatalog)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which reads the schema/instructions to prompt and validate the LLM),"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[6Cand\u001b[K\n\b\b\b• \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m's \u001b[94;1m\u001b]8;id=jk9bf21fb66df2d1fb;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007MessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>(catalogs: [a2uiCatalog])\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[80D\u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jk9bf21fb66df2d1fb;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[m reads \u001b[94m.builder\u001b[m from to build widgets).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n  \u001b[1m### Seamline 2: \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39m (\u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Notice the doc comment in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk98813ee10741f241;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/processing/processor.dart#L63-L65\u0007MessageProcessor\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n\u001b[K\n  │ \u001b[3mNot to be confused with the Agent SDK's \u001b[94;23mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;3m, which r"]
[0.000, "o", "uns the other way: it parses model output\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[3minto the payloads this consumes.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_agent\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Converts \u001b[1mraw LLM text chunks\u001b[m (\u001b[94mString\u001b[m containing Markdown + \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>...\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m</a2ui-json>\u001b[m) → \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_core\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Consumes \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m → mutates \u001b[94mSurfaceGroupModel<T>\u001b[m /\r\n  \u001b[94mSurfaceModel<T>\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mHow they connect\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[1mRemote Agent / Client split (over HTTP/WebSockets/gRPC)\u001b[m: The server runs \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor.\u001b[m\n\u001b[96D\u001b[94mopenContinuingSt\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[20D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[27A\u001b[21C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk390aa44a4e513b1f;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L64\u0007CatalogImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7eb915a055269b84;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/catalog/basic/basic_catalog.dart#L43\u0007basicCatalog()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\u001b[5C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9bdfcda9c8260969;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L134\u0007CatalogConfig(a2uiCatalog)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\u001b[27D\u001b[94;1m\u001b]8;id=jk583040babb79248f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007MessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>(catalogs: [a2uiCatalog])\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[80D\u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jk583040babb79248f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[80D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8cf11a65d4"]
