[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  \u001b]8;id=jk4849dedd5eceb662;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/catalog/basic/basic_catalog.dart#L43\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mb\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m(\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\). Because \u001b[94mComponentImplementation extends ComponentApi\u001b[m, the \u001b[1mexact same\u001b[m \u001b[94mCatalogImplementation\u001b[m object\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  can be passed to both:\n\u001b[18D• \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk69b58f5bf99e824b;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L134\u0007CatalogConfig(a2uiCatalog)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which reads the schema/instructions to prompt and validate the LLM),\r\n\u001b[6Cand\n\b\b\b• \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m's \u001b[94;1m\u001b]8;id=jk3f7cfad56df0d035;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007MessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>(catalogs: [a2uiCatalog])\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[80D\u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=j"]
[0.000, "o", "k3f7cfad56df0d035;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[m reads \u001b[94m.builder\u001b[m from to build widgets).\r\n\n\n  \u001b[1m### Seamline 2: \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39m (\u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Notice the doc comment in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaa4a4dfcbe95fea7;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/processing/processor.dart#L63-L65\u0007MessageProcessor\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n\n  │ \u001b[3mNot to be confused with the Agent SDK's \u001b[94;23mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;3m, which runs the other way: it parses model output\u001b[m\r\n  │ \u001b[3minto the payloads this consumes.\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_agent\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Converts \u001b[1mraw LLM text chunks\u001b[m (\u001b[94mString\u001b[m containing Markdown + \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>...\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m</a2ui-json"]
[0.000, "o", ">\u001b[m) → \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_core\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Consumes \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m → mutates \u001b[94mSurfaceGroupModel<T>\u001b[m /\r\n  \u001b[94mSurfaceModel<T>\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[1mHow they connect\u001b[m:\n\u001b[15D• \u001b[1mRemote Agent / Client split (over HTTP/WebSockets/gRPC)\u001b[m: The server runs \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor.\u001b[m\n\u001b[96D\u001b[94mopenContinuingStream()\u001b[m and serializes the resulting \u001b[94mAgentToRendererMessage\u001b[ms over the wire; the Flutter client\r\n\u001b[6Cfeeds those decoded JSON messages directly into \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>.processMessages(...)\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mIn-Process Agent + Renderer (like this app)\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk86a117f34e423064;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/utils/renderer_state.dart#L123\u0007RendererState.of(renderer)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and\n\u001b[77D[\u001b[94mStreamedAnswer<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m](file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.\r\n\u001b[6C0/lib/src/pr\r\n\n⢿  \u001b[90"]
