[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A      • \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b]8;id=jkc1f9fe4ce1a6e7e0;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L134\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mf\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m(\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m2\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ (which reads the schema/instructions to prompt and validate the LLM),\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6Cand\n\b\b\b• \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m's \u001b[94;1m\u001b]8;id=jk7f2e7fa9586348b2;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007MessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>(catalogs: [a2uiCatalog])\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[80D\u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jk7f2e7fa9586348b2;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/featur"]
[0.000, "o", "es/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[m reads \u001b[94m.builder\u001b[m from to build widgets).\r\n\n\n  \u001b[1m### Seamline 2: \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39m (\u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Notice the doc comment in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbabcd36164a1eda;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/processing/processor.dart#L63-L65\u0007MessageProcessor\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n\n  │ \u001b[3mNot to be confused with the Agent SDK's \u001b[94;23mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;3m, which runs the other way: it parses model output\u001b[m\r\n  │ \u001b[3minto the payloads this consumes.\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_agent\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Converts \u001b[1mraw LLM text chunks\u001b[m (\u001b[94mString\u001b[m containing Markdown + \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>...\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m</a2ui-json>\u001b[m) → \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_core\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Consumes \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m → mutate"]
[0.000, "o", "s \u001b[94mSurfaceGroupModel<T>\u001b[m /\r\n  \u001b[94mSurfaceModel<T>\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[1mHow they connect\u001b[m:\n\u001b[15D• \u001b[1mRemote Agent / Client split (over HTTP/WebSockets/gRPC)\u001b[m: The server runs \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor.\u001b[m\n\u001b[96D\u001b[94mopenContinuingStream()\u001b[m and serializes the resulting \u001b[94mAgentToRendererMessage\u001b[ms over the wire; the Flutter client\r\n\u001b[6Cfeeds those decoded JSON messages directly into \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>.processMessages(...)\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mIn-Process Agent + Renderer (like this app)\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf37ac234e2b6ce9;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/utils/renderer_state.dart#L123\u0007RendererState.of(renderer)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and\n\u001b[77D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9835269834596f65;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/processor/streamed_answer.dart#L65\u0007StreamedAnswer<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 wrap the UI's \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m directly so\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[m validates and appl"]
[0.000, "o", "ies messages straight into the live renderer in a single pass, emitting\r\n\u001b[6C[\u001b[94mAnswerTextPart\u001b[m](file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.\n\u001b[78D0/lib/src/processor/streamed_answer\r\n\n⡿  \u001b[94mLoadi\u001b[90mng...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mG"]
