[0.100, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[28A\u001b[1m### Seamline 2: \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39m (\u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[39m ↔ \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Notice the doc comment in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1048fc1a6510db1b;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/processing/processor.dart#L63-L65\u0007MessageProcessor\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n\u001b[K\n  │ \u001b[3mNot to be confused with the Agent SDK's \u001b[94;23mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;3m, which runs the other way: it parses model output\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[3minto the payloads this consumes.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_agent\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Converts \u001b[1mraw LLM text chunks\u001b[m (\u001b[94mString\u001b[m containing Markdown + \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>...\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m</a2ui-json>\u001b[m) → \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_core\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Consumes \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m → mutates \u001b[94mSurfaceGroupModel<T>\u001b[m /\r\n  \u001b[94mSurfaceModel<T>\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mHow they connect\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[1mRemote "]
[0.000, "o", "Agent / Client split (over HTTP/WebSockets/gRPC)\u001b[m: The server runs \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor.\u001b[m\n\u001b[96D\u001b[94mopenContinuingStream()\u001b[m and serializes the resulting \u001b[94mAgentToRendererMessage\u001b[ms over the wire; the Flutter client\r\n\u001b[6Cfeeds those decoded JSON messages directly into \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>.processMessages(...)\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mIn-Process Agent + Renderer (like this app)\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7f2e2a8a409fe50;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/utils/renderer_state.dart#L123\u0007RendererState.of(renderer)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and\u001b[K\n\u001b[77D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc2d70f6f01538644;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/processor/streamed_answer.dart#L65\u0007StreamedAnswer<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 wrap the UI's \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m directly so\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[m validates and applies messages straight into the live renderer in a single pass, emitting\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdb3cc2d311467f58;"]
