[0.000, "o", "51Ce.\r\n\u001b[K\n  • **What **\u001b[K\r\n⣽  \u001b[90mGenerating...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: In request-review mode, file edits are shown for approval before being applied.\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K      g., \u001b[94m⚡ Action: book_flight (destination: Kyoto)\u001b[m), and let the agent either mutate the existing surface in-place\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\n\n\u001b[104D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7b92fddf5e7f6e53;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L365-L416\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[32D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8dc1cd5d7a2883e8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L103\u0007ChatRepository.defaultA2uiCatalog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbb83d305e9e88e16;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L50\u0007ComponentImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[12D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk22aa05315a13b2dd;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart#L21\u0007ChatProject.workingDirectory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[14D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkea0a079cbc44352b;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/utils/renderer_state.dart#L59-L65\u0007RendererState\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\u001b[36D\u001b[1m"]
[0.000, "o", "What we can build\u001b[m\n\n\n\n\u001b[19D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A      g., \u001b[94m⚡ Action: book_flight (destination: Kyoto)\u001b[m), and let the agent either mutate the existing surface in-place\u001b[K\r\n      via \u001b[94mupdateDataModel\u001b[m/\u001b[94mupdateComponents\u001b[m or stream a follow-up surface.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C• Wire \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfd700cd8bff95f2f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L365-L416\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 so every regular text prompt also attaches \u001b[94mrenderer.\u001b[m\n\u001b[91D\u001b[94mgetRendererDataModel(version: A2uiProtocolVersion.v1_0)\u001b[m when active surfaces have \u001b[94msendDataModel: true\u001b[m, allowing\r\n\u001b[6Cthe user to fill out an A2UI form and type \u001b[3m\"Looks good, submit that\"\u001b[m in the Markdown composer.\r\n\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 2: Custom Workspace & Developer Catalog (\u001b[94mCatalogImplementation\u001b[39m Extensions)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Right now \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf060c94b26d93f44;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L103\u0007ChatRepository.defaultA2uiCatalog\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 uses the stock \u001b[94mbasicCatalog()\u001b[m. Because \u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[m's\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb5a261c015420432;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L50\u0007ComponentImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 lets you pair any JSON Schema with a Flutter widget builder, we can extend the catalog with\r\n  developer-focused components tailored to an Antigravity coding assistant:\r\n\n  • \u001b[94mCodeDiffCard\u001b[m: Renders a side-by-side or unified diff preview with \u001b[1mApply Patch\u001b[m / \u001b[1mDiscard\u001b[m action buttons that\r\n  trigger an \u001b[94mActionMessage\u001b[m back to the Antigravity agent.\r\n  • \u001b[94mFileTreeCard\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mWorkspaceFileCard\u001b[m: Renders clickable file badges (\u001b[94mpath\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlineStart\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlineEnd\u001b[m, \u001b[94msummary\u001b[m) for files in\r\n  the active \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdaae383bc2fb3f69;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart#L21\u0007ChatProject.workingDirectory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  • \u001b[94mCommandRunnerCard\u001b[m: Lets the agent propose"]
[0.000, "o", " a shell command with editable flags/arguments (\u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m / \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m\r\n  bound to the surface data model) and a \u001b[1mRun in Workspace\u001b[m button.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 3: Persistent Split-Pane \"Surface Canvas\" Drawer (Alongside Inline Chat Surfaces)\u001b[m\r\n\n  As noted in \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6775e51d211d37ff;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/utils/renderer_state.dart#L59-L65\u0007RendererState\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, A2UI supports two UX modes over the same \u001b[94mMessageProcessor\u001b[m: \u001b[1minline chat\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mturns\u001b[m and a \u001b[1mpersistent canvas\u001b[m where multi-turn prompts iteratively evolve a single surface.\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D• Add\r\n\n⣽  \u001b[90mGenerating...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: In request-review mode, file edits are shown for approval before being applied.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
