[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  \u001b]8;id=jkbafe421d8e037b34;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L50\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mI\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ lets you pair any JSON Schema with a Flutter widget builder, we can extend the catalog with\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  developer-focused components tailored to an Antigravity coding assistant:\r\n\n  • \u001b[94mCodeDiffCard\u001b[m: Renders a side-by-side or unified diff preview with \u001b[1mApply Patch\u001b[m / \u001b[1mDiscard\u001b[m action buttons that\r\n  trigger an \u001b[94mActionMessage\u001b[m back to the Antigravity agent.\r\n  • \u001b[94mFileTreeCard\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mWorkspaceFileCard\u001b[m: Renders clickable file badges (\u001b[94mpath\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlineStart\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlineEnd\u001b[m, \u001b[94msummary\u001b[m) for files in\r\n  the "]
[0.000, "o", "active \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk39182180260d1e27;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart#L21\u0007ChatProject.workingDirectory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  • \u001b[94mCommandRunnerCard\u001b[m: Lets the agent propose a shell command with editable flags/arguments (\u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m / \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m\r\n  bound to the surface data model) and a \u001b[1mRun in Workspace\u001b[m button.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 3: Persistent Split-Pane \"Surface Canvas\" Drawer (Alongside Inline Chat Surfaces)\u001b[m\r\n\n  As noted in \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk763838905fd02cfd;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/utils/renderer_state.dart#L59-L65\u0007RendererState\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, A2UI supports two UX modes over the same \u001b[94mMessageProcessor\u001b[m: \u001b[1minline chat\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mturns\u001b[m and a \u001b[1mpersistent canvas\u001b[m where multi-turn prompts iteratively evolve a single surface.\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D• Add a toggleable right-hand \u001b[1mA2UI Inspector / Canvas pane\u001b[m in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk13c0044"]
