[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  the active \u001b]8;id=jk3a4459c4d7e97b46;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart#L21\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mP\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mj\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m.\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mw\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mk\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mD\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4my\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mCommandRunnerCard\u001b[m: Lets the agent propose a shell command with editable flags/arguments (\u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m / \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  bound to the surface data model) and a \u001b[1mRun in Workspace\u001b[m button.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 3: Persistent Split-Pane \"Surface Canvas\" Drawer (Alongside Inline Chat Surfaces)\u001b[m\r\n\n  As noted in \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc7414fb3019285d6;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/utils/renderer_state.dar"]
[0.000, "o", "t#L59-L65\u0007RendererState\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, A2UI supports two UX modes over the same \u001b[94mMessageProcessor\u001b[m: \u001b[1minline chat\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mturns\u001b[m and a \u001b[1mpersistent canvas\u001b[m where multi-turn prompts iteratively evolve a single surface.\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D• Add a toggleable right-hand \u001b[1mA2UI Inspector / Canvas pane\u001b[m in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1106c5d684c33938;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L70-L136\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc4407f19ceee590e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u0007TopToolbar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\n\u001b[88D• Pin any active surface from \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk770374be0f1dbe98;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/surface_group_model.dart#L107\u0007renderer.model.allSurfaces\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 into the side canvas, with a live \u001b[1mData Model JSON\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1minspector\u001b[m (\u001b[94msurface.dataModel\u001b[m) and \u001b[1mComponent Tree viewer\u001b[m so you can watch data bindings (\u001b[94m@pa"]
[0.000, "o", "th\u001b[m) and component\r\n\u001b[6Cupdates mutate in real time as you chat.\r\n\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 4: Self-Healing Validation Loop (Automatic LLM Repair on \u001b[94mAnswerErrorPart\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Currently, if the LLM emits a malformed \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m block or violates a component schema, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk328d250ccecbc6e1;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L662-L665\u0007StreamedAnswer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 rolls back\r\n  that block and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdd5ad4a63346f449;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L186-L195\u0007MessageBubble\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 displays \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk25632dd896d917b7;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L352-L386\u0007_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D• Add a \u001b[1mFix Surface\u001b[m button on \u001b[94m_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m (or an automatic 1-retry self-repair option in\n\u001b[99D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5d0eb906b5e8a93d;file:"]
[0.000, "o", "///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007ChatViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) that sends the rejected \u001b[94mA2uiError\u001b[m (\u001b[94mErrorMessage(version: '1.0', error: ...)\u001b[m) back to the\r\n\u001b[6Cthread's Antigravity session so the agent repairs the surface automatically.\r\n\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Opti\u001b[m\r\n⣯  \u001b[90mGeneratin\u001b[94mg...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: In request-review mode, file edits are shown for approval before being applied.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
