[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A• \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\r\n      • Add a toggleable right-hand \u001b[1mA2UI Inspector / Canvas pane\u001b[m in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7c6023e49cabd509;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L70-L136\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke9ec3288d2e5d685;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u0007TopToolbar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\tPin any active surface from \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk348be2438c2d9ead;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/surface_group_model.dart#L107\u0007renderer.model.allSurfaces\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 into the side canvas, with a live \u001b[1mData Model JSON\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1minspector\u001b[m (\u001b[94msurface.dataModel\u001b[m) and \u001b[1mComponent Tree viewer\u001b[m so you can watch data bindings (\u001b[94m@path\u001b[m) and component\r\n\u001b[6Cupdates mutate in real time as you chat.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 4: Self-Healing Validation Loop (Automatic LLM Repair on \u001b[94mAnswerErrorPart\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Currently, if the"]
[0.000, "o", " LLM emits a malformed \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m block or violates a component schema, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk60af338fb65d8ab0;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L662-L665\u0007StreamedAnswer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 rolls back\r\n  that block and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk32c842353cdab3e2;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L186-L195\u0007MessageBubble\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 displays \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5d64a6b69362e708;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L352-L386\u0007_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\r\n      • Add a \u001b[1mFix Surface\u001b[m button on \u001b[94m_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m (or an automatic 1-retry self-repair option in\n\u001b[99D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke141f6e6e0d77f74;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007ChatViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) that sends the rejected \u001b[94mA2uiError\u001b[m (\u001b[94mErrorMessage(version: '1.0', error: ...)\u001b[m) bac"]
[0.001, "o", "k to the\r\n\u001b[6Cthread's Antigravity session so the agent repairs the surface automatically.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 5: Agent-Driven Clarification Forms (\"Ask Question\" Surface Pattern)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  When the Antigravity agent needs requirements clarified before writing code or running tools in the project\r\n  workspace:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\r\n      • Update [\u001b[94mChatRepository.\u001b[m\n\u001b[25D\u001b[94mdefaultSystemInstructions\u001b[m](file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[91D\u001b[?2026l"]
