[0.000, "o", "m\u001b]8;id=jkf7ab8e4ce638c15d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L662-L665\u0007StreamedAnswer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 rolls back\r\n  that block and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5fc00f0311b218fd;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L186-L195\u0007MessageBubble\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 displays \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbfd37b06b0813e2b;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L352-L386\u0007_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D• Add a \u001b[1mFix Surface\u001b[m button on \u001b[94m_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m (or an automatic 1-retry self-repair option in\n\u001b[99D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk54cbf5890de89fe1;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007ChatViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) that sends the rejected \u001b[94mA2uiError\u001b[m (\u001b[94mErrorMessage(version: '1.0', error: ...)\u001b[m) back to the\r\n\u001b[6Cthread's Antigravity session so the agent repairs the surface automatically.\r\n\n  "]
[0.001, "o", "──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 5: Agent-Driven Clarification Forms (\"Ask Question\" Surface Pattern)\u001b[m\r\n\n  When the Antigravity agent needs requirements clarified before writing code or running tools in the project\r\n  workspace:\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D• Update \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk28cdc41fdc0f2850;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L113-L119\u0007ChatRepository.defaultSystemInstructions\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and add starter templates so the agent emits an interactive\r\n\u001b[6CA2UI v1.0 form (\u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m with \u001b[94mchips\u001b[m/\u001b[94mcheckbox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSlider\u001b[m, and a primary \u001b[94mSubmit\u001b[m \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[6Cinstead of plain-text questions.\n\u001b[32D• When the user submits the form, the resolved JSON context is sent straight back to the agent to continue\r\n\u001b[6Cexecution.\r\n\n⡿  \u001b[90mGenerati\u001b[94mng...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────"]
