[0.050, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A      instead of plain-text questions.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C• When the user submits the form, the resolved JSON context is sent straight back to the agent to continue\r\n\u001b[6Cexecution.\r\n\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 6: A2UI Express Format Toggle (\u001b[94mDirectJsonFormatFactory\u001b[39m vs. \u001b[94mExpressFormatFactory\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m supports both \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk20ad3d9ba34cea1d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L107-L108\u0007DirectJsonFormatFactory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) and the compact token-saving A2UI Express DSL\r\n  (\u001b[94mExpressFormatFactory\u001b[m) over the exact same \u001b[94mStreamedAnswer\u001b[m and \u001b[94mMessageProcessor\u001b[m pipeline.\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D• Add a format selector in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3f00c224c6ce2822;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u0007TopToolbar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 allowing you to switch between \u001b[1mDirect JSON (\u001b[94;22m<a2ui-json>\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m and \u001b[1mA2UI Ex"]
[0.000, "o", "press\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1m(\u001b[94;22m<a2ui-express>\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m to compare streaming latency, token usage, and progressive rendering behavior.\r\n\n  ──────\r\n  Which of these options sounds most interesting to explore or implement first?\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please implement:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  - Interactive Clarifying Questions & Parameter Forms (Basic Catalog)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  - Bidirectional Renderer RPC Functions (`FunctionImplementation`)\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m─────────────────────────────────────────────── Conversation compacted ────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 2m 8s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(The code snippet shows a conditional ch"]
