[0.065, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[29A\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(README.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33;1mPending edit\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37;1m/Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/README.md\u001b[m  \u001b[32m+4\u001b[m \u001b[31m-2\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m1 \u001b[m    2. **Live Streaming A2UI v1.0 Surfaces (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`a2ui_core`\u001b[m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`a2ui_agent`\u001b[m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`a2ui_flutter`\u001b[m)**\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m2 \u001b[39;48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m-  \u001b[39m   - **Catalog & Prompt Negotiation**: Configures the A2UI v1.0 basic catalog (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`basicCatalog()`\u001b[39m),\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`A2uiGenerator`\u001b[39m, and \u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[38;2;151;198;123m`A2uiRequestProcessor`\u001b[39m (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`DirectJsonFormatFactory(progressiveKeys: {'text', 'label'})`\u001b[39m)\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39m   and injects \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`a2uiRequestProcessor.promptSnippet`\u001b[39m into \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`CustomSystemInstructions`\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m2 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m   - **Catalog & Prompt Negotiation**: Configures the A2UI v1.0 basic catalog (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`basicCatalog()`\u001b[39m) extended with\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m   custom bidirectional \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`FunctionImplementation`\u001b[39ms (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`buildAppA2uiCatalog()`\u001b[39m), \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`A2uiGenerator`\u001b[39m, and\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`A2uiRequestProcessor`\u001b[39m (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`DirectJsonFormatFactory(progressiveKeys: {'text', 'label'})`\u001b[39m) and injects\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`a2uiRequestProcessor.promptSnippet`\u001b[39m "]
[0.000, "o", "into \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`CustomSystemInstructions`\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m3 \u001b[m \u001b[6b- **Incremental `<a2ui-json>` Streaming**: Each thread owns a \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`MessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>`\u001b[m\n\u001b[106D\u001b[37m\u001b[1K (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`A2uiProtocolVersion.v1_0`\u001b[m). As chunks arrive, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`StreamedAnswer<ComponentImplementation>`\u001b[m splits responses\n\u001b[107D\u001b[37m\u001b[1K into \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`AnswerTextPart`\u001b[m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`AnswerSurfacePart`\u001b[m, and \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`AnswerErrorPart`\u001b[m, healing incomplete JSON so \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`A2uiSurface`\u001b[m\n\u001b[108D\u001b[37m\u001b[1K widgets mount and update live before \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`</a2ui-json>`\u001b[m even closes.\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m4 \u001b[39;48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m-  \u001b[39m   - **Inline Rendering & Action Forwarding**: \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`MessageBubble`\u001b[39m renders \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`AnswerTextPart`\u001b[39m via \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`MarkdownBody`\u001b[39m,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`AnswerSurfacePart`\u001b[39m via \u001b[3"]
[0.000, "o", "8;2;151;198;123m`A2uiMarkdown`\u001b[39m + \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`A2uiSurface(key: ObjectKey(surface), surface: surface)`\u001b[39m, and\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`AnswerErrorPart`\u001b[39m as an inline diagnostic banner without halting subsequent surfaces. User actions emitted on\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`renderer.model.onAction`\u001b[39m are captured per thread and can be forwarded to the agent as A2UI v1.0\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`ActionMessage`\u001b[39m payloads (with \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`a2uiRendererDataModel`\u001b[39m metadata when \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`sendDataModel: true`\u001b[39m).\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 3 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1mshift+tab\u001b[90;22m to auto-approve file edits\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1mAccept this file edit?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, accept this change\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, reject this change\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[5.174, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\n\u001b[J\u001b[31A  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 6: A2UI Express Format Toggle (\u001b[94mDirectJsonFormatFactory\u001b[39m vs. \u001b[94mExpressFormatFactory\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m supports both \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk20ad3d9ba34cea1d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L107-L108\u0007DirectJsonFormatFactory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) and the compact token-saving A2UI Express DSL\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[94mExpressFormatFactory\u001b[m) over the exact same \u001b[94mStreamedAnswer\u001b[m and \u001b[94mMessageProcessor\u001b[m pipeline.\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\u001b[K\n\u001b[17D\u001b[1K • Add a format selector in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3f00c224c6ce2822;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u0007TopToolbar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 allowing you to switch between \u001b[1mDirect JSON (\u001b[94;22m<a2ui-json>\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m and \u001b[1mA2UI Express\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[1m(\u001b[94;22m<a2ui-express>\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m to compare streaming latency, token usage, and progressive rendering behavior.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  ─"]
