[0.000, "o", "\u0007.\n\u001b[92D• The clarifying parameter form combines \u001b[94mCard\u001b[m, \u001b[94mColumn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m with a \u001b[94mrequired\u001b[m validation check, \u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mmutuallyExclusive\u001b[m chips and \u001b[94mmultipleSelection\u001b[m checkboxes), \u001b[94mSlider\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m, a live \u001b[94mformatParameterSummary\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mText\u001b[m binding,\r\n\n⣽  \u001b[90mGenerating..\u001b[94m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
