[0.000, "o", "on\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94msetSurfaceData\u001b[m): Mutates any JSON Pointer \u001b[94mpath\u001b[m in the surface's \u001b[94mDataContext\u001b[m\r\n\t  (\u001b[94mcontext.set(path, value)\u001b[m) for instant local preset/reset \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m \u001b[94maction.functionCall\u001b[ms or agent-triggered\r\n\t  \u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m updates.\r\n\t  • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk20a343a6b7bf52e8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L249-L321\u0007FormatParameterSummaryFunction\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mformatParameterSummary\u001b[m): Reactively formats clarifying form parameters\r\n\t  (\u001b[94mscope\u001b[m, \u001b[94mtarget\u001b[m, \u001b[94mfeatures\u001b[m, \u001b[94mconcurrency\u001b[m, \u001b[94msandboxed\u001b[m) into a live summary string.\r\n\n  2. \u001b[1mInteractive Clarifying Questions & Parameter Forms (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7ad9dd76b22a9eb7;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_repository.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka992788b40974c96;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_screen.dart"]
