[0.001, "o", "nal RPC execution: Agent → Renderer (\u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m → \u001b[94mRendererFunctionResponseMessage\u001b[m for\r\n\u001b[6C    \u001b[94mgetWorkspaceInfo\u001b[m and \u001b[94mlistWorkspaceFiles\u001b[m) and Renderer → Agent (\u001b[94mcallAgentFunction\u001b[m → \u001b[94mCallAgentFunctionMessage\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C    resolved by streaming \u001b[94magentFunctionResponse\u001b[m).\r\n      • \u001b[94mdart analyze\u001b[m reports \u001b[1m0 issues\u001b[m and \u001b[94mflutter test\u001b[m passes all \u001b[1m12 widget tests\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> git commit and tag as step-04-a2ui\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 2 commands \u001b[37m(git status && git tag --list · git log -n 4 --oneline)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33;1mCommand\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37;1mRequesting permission for:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m   git log -n 4 --oneline\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mRun this command?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, run command\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. Yes, and always allow in this conversation for commands that start with 'git log'\r\n  3. Yes, and always allow for commands that start with 'git log' (Persist to settings.json)\r\n  4. No, cancel\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mctrl+g\u001b[90;22m edit/expand command\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[2.063, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001b[30A\u001b[49D• The clarifying parameter form combines \u001b[94mCard\u001b[m, \u001b[94mColumn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m with a \u001b[94mrequired\u001b[m validation check, \u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m\r\n      (\u001b[94mmutuallyExclusive\u001b[m chips and \u001b[94mmultipleSelection\u001b[m checkboxes), \u001b[94mSlider\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m, a live \u001b[94mformatParameterSummary\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mText\u001b[m binding, a \u001b[94mUse Audit Preset\u001b[m \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m invoking \u001b[94msetSurfaceData\u001b[m locally via \u001b[94maction.functionCall\u001b[m, and a \u001b[94mSubmit\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mParameters\u001b[m primary \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m (gated by \u001b[94mrequired\u001b[m validation \u001b[94mchecks\u001b[m) dispatching \u001b[94msubmit_clarifying_parameters\u001b[m with\r\n\u001b[6Cthe resolved parameter context.\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[1mViewModel RPC Wiring (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcd8ff6a163635f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_view_model.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[42D• Wired \u001b[94moutboundListener\u001b[m on each thread's \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m in\n\u001b[86D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id="]
