[0.000, "o", "gentFunction\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[K\r\n  4. \u001b[1mVerification (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7837f028780db10;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/test/widget_test.dart\u0007w\u001b[22midget_test.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[30D• Added widget tests covering:\r\n\t  • Interactive clarifying parameter form rendering, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m \u001b[94mrequired\u001b[m validation disabling/enabling the\r\n\t \u001b[1K submit \u001b[94mFilledButton\u001b[m, local \u001b[94mSetSurfaceDataFunction\u001b[m preset execution, \u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m chip & checkbox toggling,\r\n\t \u001b[1K reactive \u001b[94mFormatParameterSummaryFunction\u001b[m updates, and \u001b[94mA2uiRendererAction\u001b[m + \u001b[94ma2uiRendererDataModel\u001b[m round-\r\n\t  tripping.\r\n\t \u001b[1K • Bidirectional RPC execution: Agent → Renderer (\u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m → \u001b[94mRendererFunctionResponseMessage\u001b[m for\r\n\t  \u001b[94mgetWorkspaceInfo\u001b[m and \u001b[94mlistWorkspaceFiles\u001b[m) and Renderer → Agent (\u001b[94mcallAgentFunction\u001b[m → \u001b[94mCallAgentFunctionMessage\u001b[m\r\n\t \u001b[1K resolved by streaming \u001b[94magentFunctionResponse\u001b[m).\n\u001b[50D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mdart analyze\u001b[m r"]
