[0.000, "o", ";24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\n\u001b[30D• Added widget tests covering:\r\n\t  • Interactive clarifying parameter form rendering, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m \u001b[94mrequired\u001b[m validation disabling/enabling the\r\n\t  submit \u001b[94mFilledButton\u001b[m, local \u001b[94mSetSurfaceDataFunction\u001b[m preset execution, \u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m chip & checkbox toggling,\r\n\t  reactive \u001b[94mFormatParameterSummaryFunction\u001b[m updates, and \u001b[94mA2uiRendererAction\u001b[m + \u001b[94ma2uiRendererDataModel\u001b[m round-\r\n\t  tripping.\n\u001b[9D• Bidirectional RPC execution: Agent → Renderer (\u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m → \u001b[94mRendererFunctionResponseMessage\u001b[m for\r\n\t  \u001b[94mgetWorkspaceInfo\u001b[m and \u001b[94mlistWorkspaceFiles\u001b[m) and Renderer → Agent (\u001b[94mcallAgentFunction\u001b[m → \u001b[94mCallAgentFunctionMessage\u001b[m\r\n\t  resolved by streaming \u001b[94magentFunctionResponse\u001b[m).\n\u001b[49D• \u001b[94mdart analyze\u001b[m reports \u001b[1m0 issues\u001b[m and \u001b[94mflutter test\u001b[m passes all \u001b[1m12 widget tests\u001b[m.\r\n\n\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────"]
