[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 39s\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  Here is a review of the \u001b[94magy_genui_demo\u001b[m codebase.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m## 1. Overview & Strengths\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mStatic Analysis & Tests\u001b[m: \u001b[94mdart analyze\u001b[m passes with \u001b[1m0 issues\u001b[m, and all \u001b[1m12 widget and integration tests\u001b[m in\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4ead82d95030c569;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/test/widget_test.dart\u0007widget_test.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 pass.\r\n  • \u001b[1mClean Layered Architecture\u001b[m: Clear separation between immutable domain models (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk92aa7e537a5849cb;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart\u0007chat_models.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), A2UI catalog/RPC\r\n  definitions (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc5b35cee236e466f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart\u0007renderer_rpc_functions.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), repository/session management (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk47b287b448e70089;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart\u0007chat_repository"]
[0.000, "o", ".dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), and presentation\r\n  (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9deb65e5aa314962;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007chat_view_model.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 + modular widgets).\r\n  • \u001b[1mTestability\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk88cf2c00821a76dd;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L15-L24\u0007AntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk12b9677b97e0a1ad;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L69-L73\u0007AntigravitySessionBuilder\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 cleanly decouple the UI/ViewModel from the\r\n  external \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m process, enabling fast, deterministic streaming and RPC tests.\r\n  • \u001b[1mDesktop UX Polish\u001b[m: Proper IME composition guarding in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfa68fc64d7095d42;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/markdown_composer.dart#L74-L77\u0007MarkdownComposer._isImeComposing\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, per-thread draft\r\n  preservation, and macOS \u001b[94m.app\u001b[m bundle working direc"]
[0.000, "o", "tory fallback in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5eb4a315fe5db995;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L227-L237\u0007ChatRepository.resolveDefaultWorkingDirectory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m## 2. Bugs & Functional Issues\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2.1. A2UI Surface Actions & Outbound RPC Messages Are Not Forwarded in the Live App\u001b[m\r\n\n  In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4b5ed160b6f6765c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L20-L28\u0007ChatViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, both \u001b[94mforwardSurfaceActionsToAgent\u001b[m and \u001b[94mforwardRpcMessagesToAgent\u001b[m default to \u001b[94mfalse\u001b[m:\n\n\u001b[97D\u001b[38;5;70;1mthis\u001b[38;5;252;22m.forwardSurfaceActionsToAgent = \u001b[38;5;70;1mfalse\u001b[38;5;252;22m,\u001b[m\n\u001b[42D\u001b[38;5;70;1mthis\u001b[38;5;252;22m.forwardRpcMessagesToAgent = \u001b[38;5;70;1mfalse\u001b[38;5;252;22m,\u001b[m\r\n\n  Because \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9731600dd061476e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/main.dart#L22\u0007MarkdownChatApp\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 instantiates \u001b[94mChatViewModel()\u001b[m with default parameters, "]
[0.000, "o", "clicking interactive submit buttons\r\n  on \u001b[94mA2uiSurface\u001b[m cards or executing agent-initiated \u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m calls in the live desktop app only appends\r\n  to \u001b[94m_\u001b[m\r\n⣯  \u001b[94mLoa\u001b[90mding...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medi"]
