[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  In \u001b]8;id=jkd9414fd13db09e15;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L20-L28\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mV\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mw\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mM\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\, both \u001b[94mforwardSurfaceActionsToAgent\u001b[m and \u001b[94mforwardRpcMessagesToAgent\u001b[m default to \u001b[94mfalse\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[4C\u001b[38;5;70;1mthis\u001b[38;5;252;22m.forwardSurfaceActionsToAgent = \u001b[38;5;70;1mfalse\u001b[38;5;252;22m,\u001b[m\n\u001b[42D\u001b[38;5;70;1mthis\u001b[38;5;252;22m.forwardRpcMessagesToAgent = \u001b[38;5;70;1mfalse\u001b[38;5;252;22m,\u001b[m\r\n\n  Because \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk97faa15a545ecf67;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/main.dart#L22\u0007MarkdownChatApp\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 instantiates \u001b[94mChatViewModel()\u001b[m with default parameters, clicking interactive submit buttons\r\n  on \u001b[94mA2uiSurface\u001b[m cards or executing agent-initiated \u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m calls in the live desktop app only appends\r\n  to \u001b[94m_thre"]
[0.000, "o", "adActions\u001b[m / \u001b[94m_threadOutboundRpcMessages\u001b[m without sending the response turn back to the Antigravity agent\r\n  (tests call \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk31fe1a2609b93b57;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L687\u0007sendSurfaceAction\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk79696eb9c26f99a3;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L730\u0007sendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 manually).\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2.2. Stream Self-Cancellation When Handling Outbound RPC Calls\u001b[m\r\n\n  When \u001b[94mforwardRpcMessagesToAgent\u001b[m is enabled (or when multiple RPC responses are sent), \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk691ed4affd1c17a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L217-L230\u0007_handleOutboundRpcMessage\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  synchronously invokes \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke7cf8bf1f2502779;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L730-L766\u0007sendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 → \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka74"]
[0.000, "o", "ae57dbdef7d91;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L788-L795\u0007_streamAssistantTurn\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, which immediately cancels\r\n  \u001b[94m_replySubscriptions[threadId]\u001b[m:\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mMid-stream cancellation\u001b[m: \u001b[94mStreamedAnswer.feed(chunk)\u001b[m processes \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m blocks while the assistant's stream is\r\n  still open. Firing \u001b[94msendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m synchronously inside \u001b[94moutboundListener\u001b[m cancels the in-flight assistant\r\n  stream before any trailing Markdown or subsequent chunks arrive.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mMulti-RPC collision\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkff35beaca65356ae;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L1105-L1130\u0007ChatRepository.buildWorkspaceRpcReply\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, two \u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m messages\r\n  (\u001b[94mgetWorkspaceInfo\u001b[m and \u001b[94mlistWorkspaceFiles\u001b[m) are emitted in the same block. Calling \u001b[94msendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m for the\r\n  second immediately cancels the stream subscription started for the first"]
[0.000, "o", ".\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mRecommendation\u001b[m: Queue outbound \u001b[94mRendererToAgentMessage\u001b[m items generated during a stream turn and flush them as a\r\n  single batched \u001b[94mRendererToAgentMessagePayload([...])\u001b[m after the current stream completes (\u001b[94monDone\u001b[m).\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2.3. Renaming a Thread Destroys Its Active Agent Session History\u001b[m\r\n\n  In [``\r\n⣯  \u001b[90mLoadi\u001b[94mng...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
