[0.099, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  2. \u001b[1mMulti-RPC collision\u001b[m: In \u001b]8;id=jkff54db61002750d5;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L1105-L1130\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mR\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4my\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m.\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mb\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mW\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mk\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mR\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mR\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4my\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\, two \u001b[94mcallRendererFunction\u001b[m messages\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[94mgetWorkspaceInfo\u001b[m and \u001b[94mlistWorkspaceFiles\u001b[m) are emitted in the same block. Calling \u001b[94msendRpcMessageToAgent\u001b[m for the\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  second immediately cancels the stream subscription started for the first.\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mRecommendation\u001b[m: Queue outbound \u001b[94mRendererToAgentMessage\u001b[m items generated"]
[0.000, "o", " during a stream turn and flush them as a\r\n  single batched \u001b[94mRendererToAgentMessagePayload([...])\u001b[m after the current stream completes (\u001b[94monDone\u001b[m).\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2.3. Renaming a Thread Destroys Its Active Agent Session History\u001b[m\r\n\n  In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk70e070f2b4a715a8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L515-L531\u0007ChatViewModel.renameThread\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6bbf11f0f5b73325;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L509-L525\u0007ChatRepository.getOrCreateSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n\n  • \u001b[94m_sessionMetadata\u001b[m includes \u001b[94mthreadTitle\u001b[m. Whenever a thread is renamed, \u001b[94mcloseThreadSession(threadId)\u001b[m is called (and\r\n  \u001b[94mexistingMeta == desiredMeta\u001b[m becomes \u001b[94mfalse\u001b[m), which calls \u001b[94mexistingSession.stop()\u001b[m.\r\n  • Stopping the \u001b[94mAgent\u001b[m session terminates the \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m conversation context for that thread, so the next message\r\n  in that thread starts a brand-new agent ses"]
[0.000, "o", "sion with no memory of prior messages in the thread.\r\n  • Additionally, in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka62ba4a4b7d65ea7;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L658\u0007ChatViewModel.sendMessage\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94mfinal shouldAutoTitle = !current.isAutoTitled || current.messages.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94misEmpty;\u001b[m will overwrite a user-supplied title if the user renamed an empty thread before sending their first\r\n  message (also note that \u001b[94mrenameThread\u001b[m currently has no UI trigger in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk86866377cf49b003;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/thread_sidebar.dart\u0007ThreadSidebar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 or \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk50e3d582057bbdc6;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u0007TopToolbar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007).\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m## 3. Security & Sandbox Heuristics\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### 3.1. Command Path Parsing False Positives & Bypass Vectors\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2630caffb0bed67;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_g"]
