[0.019, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[28A      • Environment variable expansions like \u001b[94m$HOME/.ssh\u001b[m or \u001b[94m${TMPDIR}/script.sh\u001b[m do not start with \u001b[94m~\u001b[m or \u001b[94m/\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n      • Relative parent traversal at the end of a path without a trailing slash (e.g., \u001b[94mfoo/..\u001b[m when not preceded by \u001b[94m..\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/\u001b[m) is missed by \u001b[94mtoken == '..' || token.startsWith('../') || token.contains('/../')\u001b[m.\r\n\n\n  \u001b[1m### 3.2. Synchronous Directory Listing on the UI Isolate\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk44379a5d5a6f80c5;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/catalog/renderer_rpc_functions.dart#L175-L192\u0007ListWorkspaceFilesFunction.execute\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 runs \u001b[94mdir.existsSync()\u001b[m and \u001b[94mdir.listSync(followLinks: false)\u001b[m synchronously on the\r\n  main UI thread, collecting and sorting all entries before applying \u001b[94m.take(limit)\u001b[m. If the workspace is a large\r\n  directory (e.g., \u001b[94m$HOME\u001b[m, which is a one-click preset in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8c5e7ef5f71647ac;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/c"]
[0.000, "o", "hat/views/widgets/project_dialog.dart#L189-L194\u0007ProjectDialog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), \u001b[94mlistSync()\u001b[m can stall UI rendering.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m## 4. UI / UX & Code Quality Observations\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mMessage Feed Scroll Behavior\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc1953b583b8ab667;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L98-L116\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 uses a \u001b[94mListView.builder\u001b[m without a \u001b[94mScrollController\u001b[m. As tokens stream\r\n  into a long Markdown or A2UI message, the viewport does not automatically scroll to keep the latest content in view.\r\n  • \u001b[1mDuplicate Typing Indicator\u001b[m: While chunks are actively streaming into an assistant \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3a0f40fa7eaecf4d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L17\u0007MessageBubble\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94misTyping\u001b[m remains\r\n  \u001b[94mtrue\u001b[m, causing \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk55422325772d13ff;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L107-L111\u0007ChatScreen\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to display \u001b[94m_TypingIndicatorBubble\u001b[m (\"Assistant is composing Markdown...\") \u001b[3mbelow\u001b[m the message\r\n  bubble that is already visibly streaming text. Showing \u001b[94m_TypingIndicatorBubble\u001b[m only before the first chunk arrives\r\n  (or when the last message is still the user's message) is cleaner.\r\n  • \u001b[1mUnused Dependency & Docs\u001b[m:\n\u001b[23D• \u001b[94mcupertino_icons\u001b[m in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk275f5c00b74c62bd;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/pubspec.yaml#L36\u0007pubspec.yaml:36\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 is unused.\n\u001b[47D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd256c5333cddef52;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/README.md#L7-L19\u0007README.md:7-19\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 has duplicate \u001b[94m2.\u001b[m section numbering under \u001b[94m## Features\u001b[m.\r\n\n  ──────\r\n  Would you like me to fix any of these issues (such as the A2UI action/RPC forwarding, multi-RPC stream batching, or\r\n  scroll/typing indicator behavior)?`\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────"]
