[2.806, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[30A  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m## 4. UI / UX & Code Quality Observations\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mMessage Feed Scroll Behavior\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc1953b583b8ab667;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L98-L116\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 uses a \u001b[94mListView.builder\u001b[m without a \u001b[94mScrollController\u001b[m. As tokens stream\u001b[K\r\n  into a long Markdown or A2UI message, the viewport does not automatically scroll to keep the latest content in view.\r\n  • \u001b[1mDuplicate Typing Indicator\u001b[m: While chunks are actively streaming into an assistant \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3a0f40fa7eaecf4d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L17\u0007MessageBubble\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94misTyping\u001b[m remains\r\n  \u001b[94mtrue\u001b[m, causing \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk55422325772d13ff;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L107-L111\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to display \u001b[94m_TypingIndicatorBubble\u001b[m (\"Assistant is composing Markdown...\") \u001b[3"]
[0.000, "o", "mbelow\u001b[m the message\r\n  bubble that is already visibly streaming text. Showing \u001b[94m_TypingIndicatorBubble\u001b[m only before the first chunk arrives\r\n  (or when the last message is still the user's message) is cleaner.\r\n  • \u001b[1mUnused Dependency & Docs\u001b[m:\n\u001b[24D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mcupertino_icons\u001b[m in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk275f5c00b74c62bd;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/pubspec.yaml#L36\u0007pubspec.yaml:36\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 is unused.\n\u001b[48D\u001b[1K • \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd256c5333cddef52;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/README.md#L7-L19\u0007README.md:7-19\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 has duplicate \u001b[94m2.\u001b[m section numbering under \u001b[94m## Features\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  Would you like me to fix any of these issues (such as the A2UI action/RPC forwarding, multi-RPC stream batching, or\r\n  scroll/typing indicator behavior)?`\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> please fix"]
